EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/state/game_ui.txt | \ntpr_n=2\ntpb_x= | R-starts-with-just-the-two-cash-rows
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/state/game_ui.txt | \ntpb_title=p2 B $960 holds\n | pane-B-is-the-first-other-player
