EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/state/game_ui.txt | \ntpb_1_label=Golden Ratio Row\n | B1-Yellow2
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/state/game_ui.txt | \ngmt_2_text=p1 offers p2  (3 new offers left)\n | the-popup-says-who-offers-whom-and-the-allowance
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/state/game_ui.txt | \ngmb_0_label=Send offer\n | NEW-mode-button
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/state/game_ui.txt | \ngmb_1_label=Partner: p2 B\n | and-the-partner-button
