EXPECT_LACKS | $T/edit/state/game_ui.txt | tpa_2_label | pane-A-has-no-third-item-any-more
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | tr_g19 | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
